1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:00,670
Hey!

2
00:00:00,670 --> 00:00:02,990
70 years ago, machines couldn't talk.

3
00:00:03,010 --> 00:00:05,270
So how did they learn? Let's play!

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,780
Round 1. 1950.

5
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:10,380
A scientist asks: can machines think?

6
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,520
1956. One summer meeting

7
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:17,420
gives it a name: Artificial Intelligence!

8
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,380
1966. The first chatbot

9
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:24,300
just repeats your words back.

10
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,240
People loved it anyway!

11
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,480
1997. A computer beats

12
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,360
the world chess champion.

13
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,260
King down, humans.

14
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,500
2012. Machines learn to see.

15
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,900
2017. Read every word at once!

16
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,780
2022. Chatbots go viral!

17
00:00:48,725 --> 00:00:50,475
And then…?

18
00:00:50,475 --> 00:00:53,095
Now? AI writes code, draws pictures,

19
00:00:53,095 --> 00:00:54,575
and made this whole film.

20
00:00:54,575 --> 00:00:56,555
Every frame you saw is code.

21
00:00:56,975 --> 00:00:58,695
So… can machines think?

22
00:00:58,695 --> 00:01:00,495
Ask me next time!
